# Card images are served from S3/CloudFront in production — not baked into the Docker image.
# Deck backgrounds live under src/resources/images/backgrounds/landscape/ (~25 PNGs) and are
# included in the image so GET /api/v1/dbv/deck-backgrounds can readdir() and validateBackgroundPath()
# works on save.
src/resources/cards/images/**

# NOTE: frontend/dist (the built v2 React SPA) is intentionally NOT ignored — it
# must be copied into the image (see Dockerfile) so Express serves v2. CI builds
# it via `npm --prefix frontend run build` before `docker build`. The `node_modules`
# rule above already excludes frontend/node_modules.
